---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<section class="w-full col-center gap-4">
    <div class="w-full max-w-6xl col-center gap-2 md:gap-18 xl:gap-20 mx-auto mt-10 py-10">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                More Than a Deal-A Shared Vision
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex items-stretch gap-8 mt-4">
                <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col px-9 py-5 gap-6 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:bg-[#EAEFF1] hover:border-gray-300">
                    <h3 class="h3-md font-medium text-gray-800">
                        Complementary Strengths:
                    </h3>
                    <p class="md:text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-gray-600">
                        Warehouster brings deep expertise in logistics planning, land acquisition, approvals & compliances, and post-development asset management. BMI contributes with world-class construction quality, timely project delivery, and strong engineering credentials.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col px-9 py-5 gap-6 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:bg-[#EAEFF1] hover:border-gray-300">
                    <h3 class="h3-md font-medium text-gray-800">
                        Holistic, One-Stop Solutions 
                    </h3>
                    <p class="md:text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-gray-600">
                        From site identification to turnkey execution and ongoing operations, this alliance offers clients an end-to-end service. This simplifies decision-making, avoids multiple vendor coordination issues, and ensures accountability and quality at every stage.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-stretch gap-8 mt-4">
                <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col px-9 py-5 gap-6 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:bg-[#EAEFF1] hover:border-gray-300">
                    <h3 class="h3-md font-medium text-gray-800">
                        Geographic Reach & Local Knowledge
                    </h3>
                    <p class="md:text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-gray-600">
                        Leveraging Warehouster’s market insights in key locations (e.g. Chennai, Bengaluru, Hosur, Madurai, etc.) together with BMI’s regional execution capabilities positions this partnership to deliver in both metro & peripheral industrial hubs.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col px-9 py-5 gap-6 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 hover:bg-[#EAEFF1] hover:border-gray-300">
                    <h3 class="h3-md font-medium text-gray-800">
                        Enhanced Operational Efficiency
                    </h3>
                    <p class="md:text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-gray-600">
                        Value-added services like warehouse automation, technology integration, supply chain optimization, and performance monitoring will help clients reduce costs, improve throughput, and adapt quickly to changing logistics demands.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>